OL,3,GNEWSAWeather warning lifted as third
OL,4,Astorm to hit Scotland eases off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA weather warning put in place as a
OL,7,Fthird storm in a matter of days hit
OL,8,FScotland has now been lifted.
OL,10,FEnergy provider SSEN said 108,000
OL,11,Fcustomers had been reconnected with
OL,12,Fjust 2,000 still without power in the
OL,13,Faftermath of Storm Boelo and several
OL,14,Fdays of high winds and heavy rain.
OL,16,FA yellow wind warning, covering most of
OL,17,Fthe country as well as parts of
OL,18,Fnorthern England and Northern Ireland,
OL,19,Fcame into effect at 03:00 but was
OL,20,Flifted at18:00.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
